{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开了曾经亲近的人，现在遇到难事只能自己扛，缓过难受后又开始想念过去有人陪伴的日子。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、孤单、失落、眷恋，略有暖意\",\n      \"missed\": \"不容易一眼抓到远去的家园在梦里显现、看得见却回不去的画面，以及心里的愿望没有回应保证、委屈终于冒头等细节。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后才发现从前有人在身边有多轻松，如今只能独自面对难事，仍然怀念那种亲密的相处。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"孤独、怀念、遗憾、害怕失去、温柔\",\n      \"missed\": \"家园在梦里显现却无法回去的具体画面，以及音乐从含蓄试探到迫切表达的变化，需要读小字才能理解；末尾的释然也不够突出。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想念曾经不用多说就能彼此亲近的日子，知道现在回不去了，但想到自己确实拥有过，心里又得到一点安慰。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、失落、不舍、释然、微暖\",\n      \"missed\": \"明知有些事已经挽不回、也不必立刻抓回来这一层具体的释然，以及前面音乐情绪逐渐展开的过程，仍然需要逐句读才能发现。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"四块主句都比较长，而且粉、蓝、白、绿四种重点同时出现，缺少一个明显的第一视觉中心。第一眼能够捞到想念、独自承担、怀念亲密和稍感温暖几个核心意思，但要把四块完整读下来，才能确认它们是同一个人的连续心理变化。尤其“远去的家园”“音乐逐渐展开”等画面和描述，第一眼不容易与他的处境、感受建立联系。三张图文字基本相同，下半部分音符动画的变化没有进一步帮助理解人物处境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bc020d19-d039-47f0-ae73-17e28cf7b073", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T001043300435Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:12:28.120215+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c34d8dbf9b791c4979bb7725153a1937c0c987e19e505e358750b88740b518f3", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T001043300435Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "30d0052efe0cfd942b6f47a5f7f57d37127d08b132b8a76fcb1290964410a88e"}}}
